From 8f75f237b4c9d4370af2c67d4a8dd8f3c166a61a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenjinhu <chenjinhu@fumobi.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:30:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Enable the standalone Android Chromium fingerprint test
 browser

Reuse native startup configuration, proxy authentication and IP coordination without linking the WebView embedder. Load the same startup file before browser network contexts, propagate redacted snapshots to all renderers, await regional IPC before commits, and preserve Chrome geolocation permissions. Apply network policies to browser and profile requests, Worker preferences, WebRTC, WebTransport and native Requested-With / User-Agent headers. Declare scoped-storage access for this test browser.

Validated with native configuration, pixel/audio, region and IP-location suites, 44 network/auth/transport/header cases, include and production GN checks, and compiled Chrome adapter translation units. Device execution remains to be validated.

